#. いや、中の人が気絶してても、
#. 背筋を伸ばした姿勢になれたはずだよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No, even if the person inside the suit were\n"
"unconscious, they could still stand up like that."
msgstr ""

#. あのジャスティスロボの衣装にあった、
#. ある<CLT 3>特徴<CLT>のお陰でね…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because that Robo Justice suit had a <CLT 3>certain\n"
"characteristic<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 腰がまったく曲がらないよ！？
#. 明らかな設計ミスじゃん！？
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You totally can't bend at the waist! Seems like a\n"
"pretty obvious oversight..."
msgstr ""

#. そうだ！　あの衣装って、
#. 設計ミスのせいで腰がまったく曲がらないんだ！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's right! They totally made a mistake when they\n"
"made it, so it couldn't bend at the waist!"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、本当に設計ミスだったのかしら…？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm not so sure that was a mistake..."
msgstr ""

#. 最初から、この画像をでっち上げる為に、
#. 計算して作られた設計だったのかもしれないわよ？
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think the suit was designed from the beginning to be\n"
"used the way it was."
msgstr ""

#. …くぅっ！
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid "Ngh...!"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさん達は、そんな特徴がある衣裳を、
#. 気絶した葉隠君に着させる事で…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Celeste and Hifumi took the suit they'd specially\n"
"designed and stuffed Hiro into it..."
msgstr ""

#. あの画像をでっち上げたんだよ。
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's how they were able to fake that whole thing."
msgstr ""

#. あの不審者の存在を、
#. ボク達に信じ込ませる為にね！
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The point of it all was to make us believe whoever was\n"
"in the suit was to blame!"
msgstr ""

#. …ぐぐぐッ！！
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid "Ngh-gh-gh!"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら…チェックメイトのようだな…
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well then, I suppose this is checkmate..."
msgstr ""

#. チェック…メイト……？
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid "Checkmate...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うふ…うふふふふ…
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid "Heh...hehehe..."
msgstr ""

#. ふ…ふ…ふふ…ふふふ…
msgctxt "0016 | CELES"
msgid "Hah...haha...hahaha..."
msgstr ""

#. ふざけてんじゃねーぞ、このダボッ！！
#. あぁ！？　何がチェックメイトだ！？
msgctxt "0017 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Don't make me laugh, you idiot! What do you mean,\n"
"checkmate!?"
msgstr ""

#. セ、セレス…ちゃん…？
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "C-Celeste...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうしても、わたくしを犯人に仕立て上げたいらしーが
#. そいつは大きな間違いですわよぉ！！
msgctxt "0019 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Clearly, you want to cram me into your little \"guilty\"\n"
"box. Well there's one little problem!"
msgstr ""

#. お忘れですかぁ？
#. 山田君が死に際に残した、あの言葉をよぉ！！
msgctxt "0020 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Have you already forgotten what Hifumi told us as he\n"
"lay dying!?"
msgstr ""

#. …ねぇ、山田。誰にやられたの！？
#. 誰があんたを襲ったの？
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, Hifumi! Who was it? Who attacked you!?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は…誰なの？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Who tried to kill you!?"
msgstr ""

#. は…んに…ん……？
msgctxt "0023 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Who...killed me...?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人の名前…僕は…知ってる…
#. 思い…出したんだ…
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "That's right... I remember...their name..."
msgstr ""

#. や…やす…
msgctxt "0025 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Y...Yasu..."
msgstr ""

#. ひ…ろ…
msgctxt "0026 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "...hi...ro..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人の名前を聞かれた山田君は、
#. ハッキリと答えていましたわよね？
msgctxt "0027 | CELES"
msgid ""
"When we asked him who had attacked him, his answer was\n"
"quite clear, was it not?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は<CLT 3>“やすひろ”<CLT>だと…
msgctxt "0028 | CELES"
msgid "He said, and I quote, \"<CLT 3>Yasuhiro<CLT>.\""
msgstr ""

#. つまり、葉隠康比呂なんだよぉぉぉぉおおおッ！！
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid "In other words, Yasuhiro Hagakureeeee!"
msgstr ""

#. お、お、俺は“やすひろ”なんて名前じゃねーって！
#. じ、実は“たろすけ”って名前で…
msgctxt "0030 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"W-Wait, but my name isn't really Yasuhiro! It's\n"
"actually Taro!"
msgstr ""

#. そういう訳のわからぬウソをつくから、
#. 話がややこしくなるのだ…
msgctxt "0031 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Your confusing statements don't make any sense. You're\n"
"only making things more complicated."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、山田君が言った“やすひろ”って、
#. 本当に葉隠君の事を指しているのかしらね？
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He did say Yasuhiro, but are we sure he was really\n"
"pointing the finger at Hiro?"
msgstr ""

#. テメー、何言ってんだ！　焼くぞ！！
msgctxt "0033 | CELES"
msgid ""
"What the hell are you talking about!? I'll burn you\n"
"alive!"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん…どういう意味？
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko...what do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""

#. フルネーム
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "He said people's last names"
msgstr ""

#. 「っち」を付ける
msgctxt "0036 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "He said \"for serious\" a lot"
msgstr ""

#. それは俺だべ！？
msgctxt "0037 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wait, isn't that me!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだった…
#. これは葉隠クンがみんなを呼ぶ時の呼び方だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh yeah... That's kinda the thing you say, huh?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ファーストネーム
msgctxt "0040 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "He gave everyone nicknames"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなに気さくじゃなかったような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Actually, no...they weren't that close...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、思い出して。
#. 彼はあなたの事を、どう呼んでたかしらね？
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Think about it. How did he used to refer to you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か…苗木誠殿って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's right... He always called me \"Mr. Naegi.\" I\n"
"remember that really well.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 思い出してみて…
#. 山田君の、みんなに対する呼び方を…
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Think back to how Hifumi used to talk to us..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼は、私達の事をどんな風に呼んでいたかしら？
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "How did he refer to each of us?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ…<CLT 3>フルネーム<CLT>だ！
#. 山田クンはみんなの事をフルネームで呼んでたんだ！
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...That's right! Our <CLT 3>last names<CLT>! He called us all by\n"
"our last names!"
msgstr ""

#. 例えば<CLT 3>“苗木誠殿”<CLT>って具合にね…
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Exactly. I know I heard him say \"<CLT 3>Mr. Naegi<CLT>\" more\n"
"than once, for example."
msgstr ""

#. だから、山田君が葉隠君を名指しするつもりなら、
#. <CLT 3>“葉隠康比呂殿”<CLT>って呼ぶはずなのよ。
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So if Hifumi *did* mean to say Hiro's name, he would\n"
"have said his last name—<CLT 3>Hagakure<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. た、たまたま…ですわ…
#. その時だけ…下の名前で呼んだのでしょう…
msgctxt "0051 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I'm sure it was just incidental—by chance he just—his\n"
"first name...!"
msgstr ""

#. たまたま…？
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Indecent...?"
msgstr ""

#. …黙ってろ。
msgctxt "0053 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't talk."
msgstr ""

#. たった１回の偶然が、その時なんて…
#. 随分と都合のいい解釈をするのね？
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Random chance... Now isn't that a convenient\n"
"explanation?"
msgstr ""

#. あり得ないわ。山田君はいつものようにフルネームで、
#. 犯人の名前を言おうとしたはずよ。
msgctxt "0055 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, there's no reason to think he would have said the\n"
"name any different than normal."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その途中で力尽きてしまった…
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But he must have run out of energy before he could say\n"
"any more."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、山田クンが示そうとしたのは…
#. 例えば、苗字が“やすひろ”の人物とか…？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So Hifumi was trying to tell us the last name of\n"
"whoever killed him...?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、そんな名前の人物など…
#. 該当する者はいないぞ…
msgctxt "0058 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "But the name he said doesn't apply to anyone here..."
msgstr ""

#. いや…ちょっと待って…
#. 可能性のある人が１人だけいるよ…
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, no, hold on...there's one person it *could*\n"
"apply to..."
msgstr ""

#. 今まで本名を明かしていない…<CLT 3>セレスさん<CLT>…
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And that's <CLT 3>Celeste<CLT>. She never actually told us\n"
"what her real name is..."
msgstr ""

#. なん…ですと…？
msgctxt "0061 | CELES"
msgid "Wh...? What did you just say?"
msgstr ""

#. 言いがかりも…そこまでくると笑えますわね……
msgctxt "0062 | CELES"
msgid ""
"To think you'd take your false accusations so far... I\n"
"don't know whether to laugh or spit..."
msgstr ""

#. おい！　適当な事を言わないでくださる？
#. わたくしが“やすひろ”なんて、ダセー苗字の訳が…
msgctxt "0063 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Come on! Enough with your idiotic blather! Yasuhiro is\n"
"a loser's name! Do I look like a loser to you!?"
msgstr ""

#. ねーーーーーーーだろがッ！！
msgctxt "0064 | CELES"
msgid "Well!? Dooooo I!?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁッ！？　ちょん切るぞッ！！
msgctxt "0065 | CELES"
msgid ""
"What!? I think I've earned the right to be a little on\n"
"edge!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら教えてよ…
#. セレスさんの本名って…なんなの…？
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, then fill us in... What's your real name?"
msgstr ""

#. よぉし！　耳の穴をガッツリかっぽじって、
#. よく聞きやがれぇぇぇえええッ！！
msgctxt "0067 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Fine! Make sure your ear holes are wiiiiiiide open and\n"
"listen up!"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしの本名はセレスティア・ルーデンベルク！
#. 何度も同じ事を言わせないで頂けますかぁ！
msgctxt "0068 | CELES"
msgid ""
"My real name is Celestia Ludenberg! Could you PLEASE\n"
"stop making me repeat myself over and over again!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさん…あくまで認めてくれないんだな…
#. だったら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Celeste still won't give up. So then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんとかして…彼女に認めさせるしかない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to do something to make her accept it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
